# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
#
# <body>
#
# <footer>
#
# Type must be one of:
# - feat:     New feature
# - fix:      Bug fix
# - docs:     Documentation only
# - style:    Formatting, no code meaning change
# - refactor: Neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
# - perf:     Performance improvement
# - test:     Adding or correcting tests
# - chore:    Build process, tooling, dependencies
#
# Scope (optional):
# - ui:       Screens and components
# - health:   Health Connect reading/writing and sync
# - photo:    On-device food photo estimates (ml/, photo flow)
# - db:       Room entities, DAOs, migrations
# - trends:   Charts and Trends screen
# - settings: Settings screen and DataStore
# - bench:    tools/food-bench model benchmark
# - build:    Gradle, dependencies, CI
# - docs:     Documentation
#
# Subject: 50 chars or less, present tense, no period.
# Body: what and why (not how). Footer: BREAKING CHANGE: …, Closes #123
#
# Examples:
# feat(photo): show estimate as a range with a portion question
# fix(health): ignore resting-burn estimates in average burned
# chore(build): bump onnxruntime-android to 1.31.0
